# The kernel's tablet mode switch reports only the back-side hall sensor
# (folded flat). yogabook-modes-handler combines it with the hinge angle into
# "Lenovo Yoga Book Posture Switch", which is on also while the machine lies
# open flat or stands in tent pose. libinput must see only that switch: two
# tablet mode switches would override each other.
ACTION!="remove", SUBSYSTEM=="input", KERNEL=="event*", ATTRS{name}=="Lenovo Yoga Book Tablet Mode Switch", ENV{LIBINPUT_IGNORE_DEVICE}="1"
